<modDesc descVersion="106">
    <author>CeberusOne</author>
    <version>0.4.2.2</version>
    <title>
        <en>FS25 Enhanced</en>
        <de>FS25 Enhanced</de>
    </title>
    <description>
        <en><![CDATA[Client-local adaptive graphics and performance governor for Farming Simulator 25.
Uses only documented Giants Engine / Settings APIs. No binary hooks.
v0.4.2.2: Settings GUI tabs + Wave-1 confirmed managers; Expert live overlay custom bars; Pro HUD FPS/frametime + sidecar DISCONNECTED; Diagnostics (CapStatus/ring log); experimental caps behind expertMode; adaptive/autoApply default off.
Soft-Apply off by default. No saveHardwareScalability / setTerrainQuality without opt-in. No engine setters from GUI. Multiplayer: client-local only (not synced).]]></en>
        <de><![CDATA[Client-lokaler adaptiver Grafik- und Performance-Governor für Landwirtschafts-Simulator 25.
Nutzt ausschließlich dokumentierte Giants-Engine-/Settings-APIs. Keine Binary-Hooks.
v0.4.2.2: Settings-GUI-Tabs + Wave-1 bestätigte Manager; Expert Live-Overlay mit Custom-Bars; Pro-HUD FPS/Frametime + Sidecar DISCONNECTED; Diagnostics (CapStatus/Ring-Log); experimentelle Caps hinter expertMode; adaptive/autoApply standardmäßig aus.
Soft-Apply standardmäßig aus. Kein saveHardwareScalability / setTerrainQuality ohne Opt-in. Keine Engine-Setter aus der GUI. Multiplayer: nur client-lokal (nicht synchronisiert).]]></de>
    </description>
    <iconFilename>icon.png</iconFilename>
